init.description:
Choose how volumes are shown: follow Home Assistant's unit system, follow the unit set in the WaterH app, or pick mL or fl. oz. The update interval is how often Home Assistant checks your WaterH account; drinks still only arrive there when the official app has uploaded them. Leave the client ID and secret empty to use the built-in values; only fill them in if WaterH changes the values in their app (see the README).

**WaterH Sync Android app (optional):** for bottle battery and charging sensors, paste this URL into the app under Settings → Home Assistant. Keep it private; anyone with it can report bottle status.

{webhook_url}
